sing Codex with a ChatGPT account.\"}\n```", "author_association": "NONE", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/comments/4019417132/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/comments/4019496212", "html_url": "https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/651#issuecomment-4019496212", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/651", "id": 4019496212, "node_id": "IC_kwDOPRF1G87vlKUU", "user": {"login": "teyrebaz33", "id": 187015378, "node_id": "U_kgDOCyWg0g", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/187015378?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/teyrebaz33", "html_url": "https://github.com/teyrebaz33", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teyrebaz33/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teyrebaz33/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teyrebaz33/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teyrebaz33/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teyrebaz33/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teyrebaz33/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teyrebaz33/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teyrebaz33/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teyrebaz33/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2026-03-08T16:44:46Z", "updated_at": "2026-03-08T16:44:46Z", "body": "Thanks for testing @yosun! Just pushed a second commit to #696 that strips the provider prefix from Codex model slugs \u2014 `openai/gpt-5.3-codex` will now be normalized to `gpt-5.3-codex` automatically.", "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/comments/4019496212/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/comments/4020281043", "html_url": "https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/651#issuecomment-4020281043", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/651", "id": 4020281043, "node_id": "IC_kwDOPRF1G87voJ7T", "user": {"login": "teknium1", "id": 127238744, "node_id": "U_kgDOB5WCWA", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127238744?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1", "html_url": "https://github.com/teknium1", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2026-03-08T23:42:51Z", "updated_at": "2026-03-08T23:42:51Z", "body": "Hey @yosun! The first bug you reported is real \u2014 when the provider resolves to OpenAI Codex, the default model (`anthropic/claude-opus-4.6`) should be automatically swapped for a Codex-compatible one. We're working on getting that fixed.\n\nRegarding the second issue in your comment \u2014 `hermes models set openai/gpt-5.3-codex` \u2014 a couple of things:\n\n1. The terminal CLI command is `hermes model` (singular, no `set` subcommand). It opens an interactive picker where you select your provider and model.\n\n2. More importantly, `hermes model` is a **terminal command** you run from your shell (outside of Hermes). When you're inside an active Hermes session (at the `\u25cf` prompt), you use the **slash commands** instead:\n   - `/model` \u2014 shows your current model and available options\n   - `/model gpt-5.3-codex` \u2014 switches to a specific model\n   - `/provider` \u2014 shows available providers\n\nSo the workflow would be either:\n- **From your terminal:** `hermes model` (interactive picker, sets your default for future sessions)\n- **Inside a session:** `/model gpt-5.3-codex` (switches model for the current session)\n\nThe first bug (Codex provider not auto-correcting the model) will be addressed shortly.", "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/comments/4020281043/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/comments/4020290506", "html_url": "https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/651#issuecomment-4020290506", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/651", "id": 4020290506, "node_id": "IC_kwDOPRF1G87voMPK", "user": {"login": "teknium1", "id": 127238744, "node_id": "U_kgDOB5WCWA", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127238744?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1", "html_url": "https://github.com/teknium1", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2026-03-08T23:49:30Z", "updated_at": "2026-03-08T23:49:30Z", "body": "Fixed in commit 95b1130. When the provider resolves to `openai-codex`, Hermes now automatically:\n\n1. **Replaces incompatible models** (e.g. `anthropic/claude-opus-4.6`) with the best available Codex model\n2. **Strips provider prefixes** (e.g. `openai/gpt-5.3-codex` \u2192 `gpt-5.3-codex`) that the Codex API rejects\n3. **Warns only when the user explicitly set** the incompatible model (silently fixes the config default)\n\nThanks to @stablegenius49 (#661) and @teyrebaz33 (#696) for their PRs which informed the final fix.", "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/comments/4020290506/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/comments/4021013468", "html_url": "https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/651#issuecomment-4021013468", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/651", "id": 4021013468, "node_id": "IC_kwDOPRF1G87vq8vc", "user": {"login": "yosun", "id": 909246, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjkwOTI0Ng==", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/909246?v=4", "gravatar_id":